_dev/loop-engineering/phases-plans/proposition-final.md-520-## Architectural decisions
_dev/loop-engineering/phases-plans/proposition-final.md-521-
_dev/loop-engineering/phases-plans/proposition-final.md-522-1. **Extend, do not replace.** `studio/shared/providers_common/` already provides discovery, manifests,
_dev/loop-engineering/phases-plans/proposition-final.md:523:   settings, health, and broken-provider isolation. The platform generalizes it; it does not introduce a
_dev/loop-engineering/phases-plans/proposition-final.md-524-   parallel framework.
_dev/loop-engineering/phases-plans/proposition-final.md-525-2. **Domains are data.** A domain catalog replaces every hardcoded domain set. The five supported
_dev/loop-engineering/phases-plans/proposition-final.md-526-   domains are `script`, `scene_blueprint`, `tts`, `storyboard`, `animator`. Adding a sixth must be a
_dev/loop-engineering/phases-plans/proposition-final.md-527-   data change, not a redesign.
_dev/loop-engineering/phases-plans/proposition-final.md-528-2b. **Music and Captions are out of scope** (owner decision, 2026-08-08). Neither is an AI module:
--
