_dev/loop-engineering/phases-plans/proposition-final.md-538-   job handle/status/progress/terminal-state contract.
_dev/loop-engineering/phases-plans/proposition-final.md-539-5. **One error boundary.** Provider failures become `ProviderError` (stable code, safe message,
_dev/loop-engineering/phases-plans/proposition-final.md-540-   retryable flag, redacted details) at the registry boundary. No raw provider exception, credential,
_dev/loop-engineering/phases-plans/proposition-final.md-541-   filesystem path, or provider-specific response crosses into workflow records or API responses.
